#!grafli v1
# {{Title}} — model diagram
# Companion board to paper.md. Purpose: {{purpose}} — so this board is a
# MODEL DIAGRAM: what feeds what, where each assumption sits, which
# quantities are measured and which derived. Started {{date}}.
#
# Skeleton. Replace every "…" with the real thing. Numbers on this board are
# measured numbers with the same provenance rule as the paper: if you cannot
# name the record it came out of, it does not go on the board.

# ── entry ──
@ box paper "Paper →\nthe lab report" 60,60 220x80 %soft &link:./paper.md
@ note legend 900,60 """
solid = measured (a probe, in a record)
dashed = derived or assumed
""" ~small

# ── inputs ──
@ box params "parameters (swept)\n…" 60,240 240x120 %clay &link:./paper.md#method
@ box fixed "held fixed\nseed 42 · 600 steps at 1/60 s" 60,420 240x120 %muted &link:./paper.md#method

# ── the model ──
@ box model "THE MODEL\n…" 400,300 280x140 %primary &link:./paper.md#the-model-and-its-assumptions
@ box assume "assumptions\n…" 400,500 280x130 %accent &link:./paper.md#the-model-and-its-assumptions

# ── what comes out ──
@ box probe1 "probe: …\nmeasured" 760,240 250x110 %teal &link:./paper.md#results
@ box probe2 "probe: …\nmeasured" 760,400 250x110 %teal &link:./paper.md#results
@ box derived "derived\n…" 760,560 250x110 %plum &link:./paper.md#results

# ── the answer ──
@ box answer "THE NUMBER\n… ± …\nrecord: intro-42" 1080,340 260x140 %highlight &link:./paper.md#results
@ box limits "limitations\nbeyond … the answer\nstops being trustworthy" 1080,540 260x130 %rose &link:./paper.md#limitations

# ── arrows ──
@ arrow params -> model
@ arrow fixed -> model
@ arrow assume -> model "constrains" !dashed
@ arrow model -> probe1
@ arrow model -> probe2
@ arrow probe1 -> derived !dashed
@ arrow probe2 -> derived !dashed
@ arrow derived -> answer
@ arrow answer -> limits !dashed

# ── the lab itself ──
@ note scen 60,620 """
scenarios (keys 1-2)
1 intro - …
2 … - …
""" ~small &link:./paper.md#method

@ note keys 60,800 """
keys
1-2 presets · T tour · F frame · 0 reset
arrows/WASD travel · Shift+arrows turn
Shift+R record · ? every key
""" ~small &link:./paper.md#how-to-run-it
